a\u000aMode: interactive. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: Simulation avec un fichier lisible choisi par l’utilisateur.\u000aExpected:\u000aposition (i64) = 1\u000anonempty-result (bool) = true\u000adirectory (bool) = false\u000aerror-out (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\u000a","documentation_uri":"","name":"Lire la position et la taille d’un fichier","name_source":"document","program_version":"0.0.0.0","tags":["typed","deterministic","file","example"]},"storage":{"array_mode":"automatic","version":1},"title":"Lire la position et la taille d’un fichier"}
